abstract: >-
  A privacy-first web tool for reviewing and anonymizing qualitative texts in
  the social sciences. Client-side browser interface (React, GLiNER2 / ONNX,
  optional Albert generative mode). Interactive NER review, batch processing,
  audit reports, and Label Studio export.
